# hoodoos/ — local cache of published external knowledge.
#
# PDFs are .gitignore'd because the project does not own copyright to them.
# Read locally for analysis; redistribution would violate the publishers'
# terms. The per-paper metadata (DOI, title, link, retrieval notes) is
# documented in README.md, which DOES land in git.

*.pdf
*.PDF
*.djvu

# Allow README.md and any other non-PDF metadata to be committed
!README.md
!.gitignore
